MSVC conformance corpus -- tests/conformance/msvc-llvm-corpus.txt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The mangled names are LLVM's demangler test corpus (llvm/test/Demangle/ms-*.test),
used under the Apache License 2.0 with the LLVM exception. The expected column
was produced by running llvm-undname over them.

tests/conformance/msvc-arm64ec.txt, msvc-suppressions.txt, msvc-dbghelp.txt and
msvc-name-only.txt are derived from the same names: the first inserts the ARM64EC
marker into each, and the others record what llvm-undname's flags and
dbghelp.dll's UnDecorateSymbolName print for them.

