Itanium conformance corpus -- tests/conformance/itanium-libcxxabi.txt.gz
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Transcribed from LLVM's libcxxabi/test/DemangleTestCases.inc
(https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project), mangled names and expected output both,
used under the Apache License 2.0 with the LLVM exception.

