GNU libiberty conformance corpora -- tests/conformance/d-libiberty.txt,
tests/conformance/ada-libiberty.txt, tests/conformance/gnuv2-libiberty.txt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Transcribed from GCC's libiberty test suite (https://gcc.gnu.org/): the D
vectors from libiberty/testsuite/d-demangle-expected on GCC's master branch, and
the Ada/GNAT and pre-Itanium C++ vectors from
libiberty/testsuite/demangle-expected at GCC 8.3.0. Mangled names and expected
output both come from those files, reformatted here as tab-separated rows. They
are part of GCC, which is distributed under the GNU General Public License.

