Swift conformance corpora -- tests/conformance/swift-upstream.txt,
tests/conformance/swift-simplified.txt, tests/conformance/swift-refusals.txt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Transcribed from the Swift compiler's test/Demangle/Inputs/manglings.txt and
simplified-manglings.txt (https://github.com/swiftlang/swift), mangled names and
expected output both, used under the Apache License 2.0 with the Runtime Library
